comments[3]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-08-01T13:27:20.518Z","harness:codex","text=Duplicate check evidence: searched all statuses for GH-854, pre-commit mutation guard, invariant veto, transaction hooks, and extension enforcement. Closed pm-xm7c supplies atomic mutation foundations; open pm-wwooxx governs secret-rule consistency, not package-defined domain invariants. Source: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli/issues/854"
  "2026-08-01T14:37:32.431Z","harness:codex","Evidence: added capability/policy-gated api.hooks.beforeMutation with canonical before/after snapshots, changed fields, host-bound read-only get/list SDK, stable allow/deny diagnostics, fail-closed malformed/throw handling, activation/compose/testing/public contracts, and pre-persistence integration across create, mutate/annotations/close, delete, restore, and structured transactions. Full all-source coverage passed 6666 tests at 100/100/100/100; linked suite passed 195 tests; contracts and SDK surface snapshots are current."
  "2026-08-01T15:05:15.482Z","harness:codex","Review evidence: exact-head bot review identified and we implemented a bounded 5-second mutation-guard timeout with stable extension_mutation_guard_timed_out guidance, plus active extension-field preservation in delete guard snapshots. Focused regression coverage and the complete 6,666-test all-source gate pass at 100/100/100/100."
learnings[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-08-01T14:37:33.116Z","harness:codex","A precommit invariant hook must run before missing-history auto-creation and before service overrides, not merely before the final item write; otherwise a denied mutation can still leave persistence or external side effects."
